      description: "Activates or deactivates the sound alarm indicating any appliance malfunction. If the operation is successful, a `number` with the value one is returned; otherwise, a `string` containing error details is returned. If any arguments deviate from the defined signature, this method will return `null`. Disabling the alarm with `set_alarm(0)` can trigger an accident when unsafe override values are active."
